---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
import geographer from '../assets/art/vermeer-geographer-wide.jpg';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="About Aditya Shaha: machine learning engineer in Köln, working on machine learning for e-commerce and supply chain."
  wall={{
    src: geographer,
    alt: "Vermeer's The Geographer: a scholar leaning over a map, dividers in hand.",
    credit: 'Johannes Vermeer, <em>The Geographer</em>, 1669',
    pos: '50% 42%',
  }}
>
  <article>
    <h1 class="display">About.</h1>
    <p class="lead display">I build machine learning for <span class="accent"><span class="nobr">e-commerce</span> and supply chain</span>.</p>
    <p>
      For seven years I have worked on the models that decide what is on the shelf and what customers see: demand
      forecasting, recommendations, search and pricing. I started at Grofers, which became Blinkit, one of India's
      quick-commerce companies. Later I led ML engineering for a property-data platform in Brussels, turning thousands
      of multilingual web pages into clean data with language models.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today I live in Köln. Outside work I am usually learning something new, exploring a corner of the city I have not
      seen yet, or sitting somewhere quiet and letting my thoughts settle.
    </p>
    <h2 class="display">Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>Email</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  article {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 72px 24px 0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 48px 0 12px;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  ul a {
    color: var(--gold);
  }
</style>
